{"id":"dd5d746ea1792bf7","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-degree-cupping-capping.md","title":"Cupping, Capping, and Their Failures","display":"df-degree-cupping-capping — Cupping, Capping, and Their Failures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-degree-cupping-capping","aliases":["67-df-degree-cupping-capping"],"display":"df-degree-cupping-capping — Cupping, Capping, and Their Failures","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"7","source_label":"definitions after Corollary 7.1; cupping degree before Theorem 7.4","source_printed_pages":[96,98],"source_pdf_pages":[107,109],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"definition-and-signature-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-degree-cupping-capping"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-degree-cupping-capping</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-cupping-capping — Cupping, Capping, and Their Failures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"definitions after Corollary 7.1; cupping degree before Theorem 7.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>96</span><span>98</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>107</span><span>109</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-and-signature-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\">\\(\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in D_T\">\\(a,b,c\\in D_T\\)</span>。下式引入二元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cap}_T,\\mathrm{Cup}_T,\\mathrm{NC}_T,\\mathrm{NU}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Cap}_T,\\mathrm{Cup}_T,\\mathrm{NC}_T,\\mathrm{NU}_T\\)</span> 和一元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cupping}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Cupping}_T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cap}_T(b,a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_Tb\\land\\exists c\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_Tc\\land b\\wedge_Tc=a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cap}_T(b,a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_Tb\\land\\exists c\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_Tc\\land b\\wedge_Tc=a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cup}_T(a,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_Tb\\land\\exists c\\in D_T\\;(c&lt;_Tb\\land a\\vee_Tc=b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cup}_T(a,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_Tb\\land\\exists c\\in D_T\\;(c&lt;_Tb\\land a\\vee_Tc=b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}_T(a,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_Tb\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Cap}_T(b,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NC}_T(a,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_Tb\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Cap}_T(b,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NU}_T(a,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_Tb\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Cup}_T(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NU}_T(a,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_Tb\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Cup}_T(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cupping}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\forall b\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\mathrm{Cup}_T(a,b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cupping}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\forall b\\in D_T\\;(a&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\to\\mathrm{Cup}_T(a,b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷96页/PDF107页的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> caps to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 要求见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c&gt;a\">\\(c&gt;a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> cups to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 要求见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c&lt;b\">\\(c&lt;b\\)</span>。这里保留这些严格不等式，避免用底元或顶元形成平凡见证。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}_T(a,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{NC}_T(a,b)\\)</span> 对应原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\ll_{\\cap}b\">\\(a\\ll_{\\cap}b\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NU}_T(a,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{NU}_T(a,b)\\)</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\ll_{\\cup}b\">\\(a\\ll_{\\cup}b\\)</span>；第7章§2起无下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ll\">\\(\\ll\\)</span> 指前者。</p>\n<p>印刷98页/PDF109页给出 cupping degree 的全称定义。谓词是相对于固定度序与格运算的元语言定义，不是可解释性的对象语言公式。定义本身不声称存在某种见证，也不把来源格定理的证明链升级为全核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-latt